## Tags tab — information architecture

### Navigation (pinned, not scrolled)

`SidebarPanel` → `navigation`:

| Row | Icon | Opens |
|-----|------|--------|
| Section header | — | **Tags** (static label) |
| All tags | `CustomIcons.Tag` | Page: all tags |
| Untagged | `CustomIcons.CircleDashed` | Page: untagged items |

Nav rows only. `onClick` sets `destination.kind === 'nav'`.

### Scrollable content

`SidebarPanel` → direct `<Section>` siblings:

| Section | Contents |
|---------|----------|
| **Favorites** | `<Group>` of favorite tag rows, or `emptyMessage`: `No favorite tags yet` |
| **Others** | `<Group>` of non-favorite tag rows, or `emptyMessage`: `No tags yet` |

Both sections: `collapsible`, header `onClick` → section page, chevron `onToggle` only, `active` independent of `isExpanded`. Default **expanded** in demo.

### Tag rows

Flat leaf rows — **no** `hasInlineSlot`, **no** `hasInlineCaret`, **no** `indentDepth`.

| Slot | Content |
|------|---------|
| `startSlot` | `TagSwatch` — `CustomIcons.SquareFill` tinted per tag metadata |
| Label | Tag name (`interactive-item__label`) |
| `endSlot` | `CountBadge` with tag `count` (hidden when `count <= 0`) |

**Tag color metadata** (`design-system/tag-colors.ts`):

```ts
type TagColors = { background: string; border: string };
// Background: --tag-{palette}-bg. Sidebar swatch stroke: --border-strong (all palettes).
```

`SquareFill` reads `--tag-swatch-bg` and `--tag-swatch-border` set on `.tags-tab__swatch` (not `interactive-item__icon`).

Nav rows use `Tag` / `CircleDashed` in `interactive-item__icon` — different from tag swatches.

### Tags tab state

```ts
type TagsDestination =
  | { kind: 'nav'; id: 'all-tags' | 'untagged' }
  | { kind: 'section'; id: 'favorites' | 'others' }
  | { kind: 'tag'; id: string };
```

- One `destination` at a time (nav, section page, or selected tag).
- `expandedSections`: `favorites` | `others` — separate from selection.

