## Shared list components

### `CountBadge`

Generic numeric badge (`components/CountBadge.tsx`). Used in `InteractiveItem` `endSlot` and elsewhere — not tab-specific.

| Rule | Value |
|------|--------|
| Height | `var(--height-md)` |
| Color | `var(--text-placeholder)` |
| Hidden when | `count` is missing, invalid, or `<= 0` (returns `null`) |
| Cap | `max` prop (default **99**): `count > max` → `{max}+` (e.g. `100` → `99+`) |

```tsx
endSlot={<CountBadge count={itemCount} />}
```

Wrap in `SidebarHoverReveal` when the badge should hide until sidebar hover (desktop).

### `SubtaskCountBadge`

Subtask progress fraction for **task parent rows** (`components/SubtaskCountBadge.tsx`). Tasks tab only — not tags or notes.

| Rule | Value |
|------|--------|
| Format | `{completed}/{total}` (e.g. `2/3`) |
| Shown when | Parent task has at least one **direct** subtask in loaded data |
| Hidden when | No subtasks (`total <= 0`) |
| Style | Same tokens as `CountBadge` (`subtask-count-badge.css`) |

```tsx
endSlot={
  <SidebarHoverReveal>
    <SubtaskCountBadge completed={completed} total={total} />
  </SidebarHoverReveal>
}
```

**FUTURE (DB):** Wire `completed` / `total` from server fields when subtasks are not fully loaded in the tree.

### `SidebarHoverReveal`

Opt-in wrapper (`components/SidebarHoverReveal.tsx`). Hides children until pointer is over `.clutter-sidebar` (desktop); always visible on touch. Use per control in `endSlot`, not for the whole slot.

